raye-theme (0.1~dev7) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Ctrl + wheel on the desktop resizes the icons, the Windows habit Plasma
    does not have: measured on Plasma 6.6.6, the Folder view containment
    handles no wheel event at all. It is done through Plasma's own
    containment actions rather than a patched copy of the containment, so
    nothing of Plasma's is forked. The desktop is found by what it is -- the
    containment whose plugin is a Folder view -- never by its number, which
    Plasma hands out as it makes them.
  * The desktop layout is tested for the first time: it is the script every
    new account runs, and the wheel block sits last and inside a try, so a
    failure there can never cost someone their taskbar.

